<title>USA: FSA qualifies four muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies four muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>FSA said Tuesday it qualified for bond insurance the following four municipal bond issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Lyndhurst Township, N.J., $3.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Lyndhurst Township, N.J., $7.1 million GOs.</p>
<p>--South Brunswick Township, N.J., $3.9 million and $3.8 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Spingfield Township, N.J., $4.1 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
